<title>USA: Group has stake in Barnes &amp; Noble.</title>
<headline>Group has stake in Barnes &amp; Noble.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investor Leon Cooperman said it holds a stake in Barnes &amp; Noble Inc of 5.2 percent, or 1,709,600 shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it bought shares between December 16 and February 13 at prices ranging from $26.00 a share to $32.50 a share.</p>
<p>The group said it holds the stake for investment purposes.</p>
